WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
Two atoms of radius 1.8 Å are 4.2 Å apart. The probe radius is 1.4 Å.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.600
The dashed SAS follows the center of the rolling probe.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.200
The solid SES follows contact arcs and the inner arc swept between the atoms.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.000
Both curves use the same atoms and solvent probe.
